  "category": "sliders-carousels",
  "isReactBits": false,
  "description": "Full-screen slideshow of bento-style image grids. Each slide has its own tile layout, and tiles are covered and uncovered by staggered color wipes when moving between slides, with a hover tint and mouse parallax.",
